\" font-weight=\"700\">e<tspan dy=\"-5\" font-size=\"11\">−r²</tspan><tspan dy=\"5\"> = 0.5 gives r = 0.833</tspan></text><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"340.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\" font-weight=\"700\">(a) sphere, centre (2, 3, 1), radius 5:  x² + y² + z² − 4x − 6y − 2z − 11 = 0</text>",
   "aria": "A graph of field against x from −2 to 6: two dashed bell curves centred at 0 and 4, their solid sum, a dashed threshold line at 0.5 crossing each bell at 0.833 units from its centre, and the midpoint value 0.037 marked at x = 2."
